<title>USA: Farmer Mac files for $1 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Farmer Mac files for $1 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Agricultural Mortgage Corp filed Tuesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $1 million in guaranteed agricultural mortgage-backed securities.</p>
<p>The securities represent ownership in a pool of agricultural real estate mortages guaranteed by the U.S. Secretary of Agriculture.</p>
<p>Farmer Mac, based in Washington DC., deals in the agricultural loan and secondary mortgage market.</p>
</text>
